                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                          rdfs:label "certified email address";
                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Email that is officially registered and with the same validity as certified (snail) mail.";
                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <mailto:elettorale@pec.comune.trento.it>;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The value should be a mailto: URL.",
                                                                          "euBusinessGraph does not record other company emails, so there is no need to distinguish between different kinds".
