                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This may or may not be the same as the dissolution date of the company. Even when it is about the official registration, the two dates may differ, depending on business rules.".
<http://schema.org/foundingDate> ebg:order 13 ;
