                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "If data is integrated from several providers, we may end up with multiple coordinate pairs in that node, which will need to be resolved into one.".
<http://schema.org/identifier> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://schema.org/Organization>,
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/person#Person>;
